{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras/3debb0ea25d034f3391f95b4c74eabd0.avif?t=1771251576\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras_big/3debb0ea25d034f3391f95b4c74eabd0.avif?t=1771251576 width=800 height=355 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Cat Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Warfare is an arena shooter featuring fast-paced action and a classic multi-weapon arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras/a3e60b1ba864a796ed4b936a88709b52.avif?t=1771251576\" alt=\"Multiple Gamemodes\" width=781 height=82 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Classic Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Team Deathmatch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Capture The Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Cursed Capture The Flag</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras/83456a52560a951abd1e02137ce18c2f.avif?t=1771251576\" alt=\"Arsenal of Weapons\" width=781 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your poison!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nail Gun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plasma Gun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Minigun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Shotgun </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rocket Launcher </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sniper Rifle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tesla Gun </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You chose the firepower to finish the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras/e2e4e864e345afa7eea2bddf9a48dbde.avif?t=1771251576\" alt=\"Different Environments\" width=781 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in a city, space or even a factory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the fight anywhere, anytime. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/extras/85b796236fe7a58f0335864836321b09.avif?t=1771251576\" alt=\"Free versus Full DLC\" width=781 height=82 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Free Version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Hosting a match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Joining a match</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Server browser</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Custom cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Calling cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Access to game events</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full DLC Gets You</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gear colors. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Clan Tags. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > DLC Calling cards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 1000 catTags upon buying. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Plus all the free version stuff! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please Report any bugs to the discussions form or our Discord. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not-So Classic Games does not condone the act of hurting cats.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/923370?t=1771251576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/923370/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771251576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass